encryption-panel-off = Messages in this chat are not end-to-end encrypted. Starting encryption needs no answer from the other person, and either of you can turn it off again, visibly.
encryption-panel-experimental = Experimental: this has not had its outside security review yet, so do not rely on it to protect anything.
encryption-panel-code = Security code
